aml:RoleClass a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
              <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "RC"@en;
              <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "RoleClasses are vendor independent and generic entities. They are used to assign a generic semantics to an object instance and to describe requirements of this object instance. Also, they can help in mapping data models of different engineering tools."@en;
              <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "RoleClass"@en.
aml:RoleClassLib a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
