                       <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Reference an Internal Link with an element B"@en;
                       <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "hasRefPartnerSideB"@en.
aml:hasRefRoleClassPath a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>;
