               <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Connects the InterfaceClasses with other InterfaceClasses that are part of the given Interface Class"@en;
               <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "isPartOfIC"@en.
aml:isPartOfIE a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>,
